---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
    title="Privacy Policy | Tanner Atkinson"
    description="What information this site collects and how it's used."
>
    <main class="bg-cream dark:bg-gray-900 min-h-screen">
        <section class="py-20 px-4">
            <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
                <h1 class="text-4xl font-display font-bold text-earth dark:text-white mb-2">
                    Privacy Policy
                </h1>
                <p class="text-sm text-earth/60 dark:text-gray-400 mb-10">
                    Last updated: September 16, 2026
                </p>

                <div
                    class="prose prose-earth dark:prose-invert max-w-none space-y-8 text-earth/80 dark:text-gray-300"
                >
                    <section>
                        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-earth dark:text-white mb-3">
                            What this site collects
                        </h2>
                        <p>
                            This is a personal portfolio site. It does not run analytics, ads, or
                            tracking scripts, and it does not sell or share personal data with
                            anyone. The only personal information collected is what you choose to
                            submit through the <a href="/contact" class="text-accent underline"
                                >contact form</a
                            >: your name, email address, subject, and message.
                        </p>
                    </section>

                    <section>
                        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-earth dark:text-white mb-3">
                            How the contact form works
                        </h2>
                        <p>
                            Contact form submissions are sent directly to <a
                                href="https://formspree.io/legal/privacy-policy"
                                target="_blank"
                                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                                class="text-accent underline">Formspree</a
                            >, a third-party form-processing service, which forwards them to the
                            site owner's email inbox. Submissions do not pass through or get
                            stored on this site's own servers or database. Formspree's own
                            privacy policy governs how it handles that data in transit.
                        </p>
                    </section>

                    <section>
                        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-earth dark:text-white mb-3">
                            Cookies and local storage
                        </h2>
                        <p>
                            This site does not use tracking or advertising cookies. It stores a
                            single preference — light or dark theme — in your browser's local
                            storage, purely so the site remembers your choice on your next visit.
                            That value never leaves your browser.
                        </p>
                    </section>

                    <section>
                        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-earth dark:text-white mb-3">
                            Fonts and hosting
                        </h2>
                        <p>
                            Fonts are served directly from this site rather than from a
                            third-party font CDN, so visiting this site doesn't share your IP
                            address with an external font provider. The site itself is hosted on
                            AWS.
                        </p>
                    </section>

                    <section>
                        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-earth dark:text-white mb-3">
                            Questions
                        </h2>
                        <p>
                            If you have questions about this policy or want a contact form
                            submission deleted, reach out at <a
                                href="mailto:koapono@byu.edu"
                                class="text-accent underline">koapono@byu.edu</a
                            >.
                        </p>
                    </section>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>
</BaseLayout>
